{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國衛生部門周四（22日）公布，該國發現全球首宗沙蒙達病毒人類感染病例，六旬患者已於本月初死亡。</p><p>沙蒙達病毒（Shamonda virus）主要通過吸血蠓蟲傳播給動物，該病毒於1960年代中期首次在尼日利亞被發現，此後在西非、東非、非洲南部以及日本的牛群中有零星報告。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.071601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:55:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:38:50.940514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.575932+00:00","content_hash":"3b529a1e6940adc020b709cb7ab4017a021bb58730a43a217edf406e9a087c2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}